{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26126","headline":"花发上林 · 侯冽","name":"花发上林","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"花发三阳盛，香飘五柞深。\n素晖云积苑，红彩绣张林。\n落水随鱼戏，摇风映鸟吟。\n琼楼出高艳，玉辇驻浓阴。\n乱蝶枝开影，繁蜂蘂上音。\n鲜芳盈禁籞，布泽荷天心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"侯冽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}